Faiss CPU distance kernels
==========================

faiss-1.11.0.tar.gz is the unmodified upstream release archive.
Source: https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/releases/tag/v1.11.0
SHA-256: c5d517da6deb6a6d74290d7145331fc7474426025e2d826fa4a6d40670f4493c

src/Makevars.in selects the source files required by knn_L2sqr and
knn_inner_product. r-compat.patch applies to the extracted build tree.
It enables static linking and standard alignment on Windows and reports
Faiss assertion failures as exceptions. The search algorithms are upstream.
